<title>BELGIUM: PetroFina H1 1997 net profit jumps 61 pct.</title>
<headline>PetroFina H1 1997 net profit jumps 61 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997 (in billions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			10.81 v    6.70</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			 11.21 v    7.04</p>
<p>    Operating profit			24.04 v   17.67</p>
<p>    Cash flow				 28.1  v   21.4</p>
<p>    Turnover				 348.6, up 22 pct</p>
<p>    Net financial charges		  2.36 v    2.46</p>
<p>    Taxes				     10.23 v    8.15</p>
<p>    Exceptional charges		    0.3  v    0.01</p>
<p>NOTE - PetroFina is a Belgian oil and gas group.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
